         <div n="1">
            <p>The Shang in the time of Wu Ding, about 1260 BC: the passage from the Middle Shang to Yinxu Phase I, the Zhukaigou people's move from the Ordos into Shaanxi, Wu Ding's campaigns in the Wei valley, and the first appearance of the cultures taken to be the Zhou.</p>
